              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabiigu beega ak gwadukuta mutukwajeega ea fuga ding'da faraasajeega ea shirikareesean bea Farao ea fuga eadu geeshteaba saawa aba jeeda basooda, ak ea manda dea abit bea jeenyaawa eara akaleala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
