              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea fuga Israeli gaweay aba ng'eanyiida ghajaam aba bugusta basooda, nea beega gawuurji ghamarda aba heanyaawa bea geatinda dugwa ea geatinda ghaadaam.",
          "type": "text",
